【来源1】{"claim": "John believes schools and infrastructure should be funded properly.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-17T11:01:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photo of a group of men working on a building] Growing up, I saw how lack of education and crumbling infrastructure affected my neighborhood. I don't want future generations to go through that, so I think schools and infrastructure should be funded properly. Here's a pic of a school last year, after they got the funding.", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "last year", "start": "2021-01-01", "end_exclusive": "2022-01-01", "precision": "year", "rule": "source_relative_year"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源2】{"claim": "John's group is brainstorming initiatives to help underserved communities access education, mentorship, job training, and resume building, aiming to empower individuals to achieve their aspirations.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-01T20:30:00+00:00", "text": "John: We're brainstorming some to help underserved communities get access to education, mentorship, job training, and resume building. The goal is to empower individuals in achieving their aspirations.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源3】{"claim": "John says Maria's encouragement means a lot to him.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks, Maria. Your encouragement means a lot to me. It's true that with effort and support, we can make a real difference in our community.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源4】{"claim": "John's family helps him stay centered and reminds him why he is passionate about making a positive impact.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks, Maria. They really help me stay centered. They remind me why I'm so passionate about making a positive impact.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源5】{"claim": "John agrees they should fight for more money and resources for their schools.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00+00:00", "text": "John: Yup, education is essential for a successful society. I totally agree that we should fight for more money and resources for our schools. It breaks my heart that our kids don't have the proper stuff they need. They deserve better.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源6】{"claim": "John states that the extra funding enabled needed repairs and renovations, making the learning environment safer and more modern for students.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-17T11:01:00+00:00", "text": "John: It enabled needed repairs and renovations, making the learning environment safer and more modern for students.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源7】{"claim": "Maria proposes fighting for more money and resources for schools and raising awareness about the importance of education.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: Hey John, cool that you made it. You're right, it's really sad to see the state of education. We should fight for more money and resources for schools and raise awareness about the importance of education. It's not just for our kids, but for all of us too!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源8】{"claim": "Maria states that uniting is essential for making a difference and that standing together allows them to tackle any problems and build a great community.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "local_override": false, "origin": "compressed_memory"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "Maria", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "Maria: Agreed, John! Uniting is essential for making a difference. if we stand together we can tackle any problems and build a great community.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源9】{"claim": "John's service-focused online group held events where they met people, including going to a homeless shelter to give out food and supplies.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-01T20:30:00+00:00", "text": "John: We held some events and got to meet some people. We went to a homeless shelter to give out food and supplies. Seeing the smiles on their faces, we knew we made a real difference. We also organized a toy drive for kids in need. It was amazing seeing the community come together to spread some joy.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源10】{"claim": "John states that joining forces together can achieve great things.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photography of a man and a woman shaking hands] Yeah, Maria! We can achieve great things if we join forces together.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源11】{"claim": "John has a community meeting next week where education and infrastructure upgrades will be discussed.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "planned", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "John: Next week I have a community meeting coming up, we'll be discussing education and infrastructure upgrades.", "context_only": false, "time_derivations": [{"expression": "Next week", "start": "2023-01-16", "end_exclusive": "2023-01-23", "precision": "week", "rule": "iso_monday_week"}]}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源12】{"claim": "John notes his own kids have a lot while others don't, and says something must be done about it.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00+00:00", "text": "John: It's definitely isn't, Maria. My kids have so much and others don't. We really need to do something about it.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源13】{"claim": "Maria's notes gave John new ideas and plans for the community.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks, Maria! You're super helpful. That gives me some new ideas and plans for our community!", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源14】{"claim": "John's family is the reason he never gives up, and their love gives him strength.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photography of a family having a picnic in the park] Thanks a lot, Maria. Your help is really motivating and makes me more determined. Here's a pic of my family - they're the reason why I never give up. Their love gives me strength.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源15】{"claim": "John's family is his rock in tough times and always cheers him on; family time means a lot to him.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "John: [Image: a photography of a family enjoying a ride on a swing] Yeah, they are my rock in tough times and always cheer me on. I'm really thankful for their love. Family time means a lot to me.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源16】{"claim": "John likes to look at the sunset to calm down, as it reminds him to enjoy the small things in life.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks, Maria! I like to just take a look at the sunset- it reminds me to enjoy the small things in life.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源17】{"claim": "John recently failed the military aptitude test.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-01T20:30:00+00:00", "text": "John: Thanks, Maria! I really appreciate your support, It means a lot to me. Especially after I failed the military aptitude test recently, I've been feeling a bit stressed out.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源18】{"claim": "John talked to someone who shared stories that fired up his passion to improve education in his area.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2022-12-22T18:10:00+00:00", "text": "John: I just talked to someone who shared some amazing stories. It really fired up my passion to make education better in our area.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
【来源19】{"claim": "After making it through the incident, John felt relieved and grateful.", "attributes": {"status": "active", "assertion": "stated", "origin": "indexed_sweep"}, "source_events": [{"speaker": "John", "role": "user", "occurred_at": "2023-01-09T19:06:00+00:00", "text": "John: I felt relieved and grateful to make it through without incident.", "context_only": false}], "provenance": "resolved"}
