 That's sweet. Spreading kindness and support can really make a difference, especially when someone is feeling down. Thanks for sharing.", "speaker": "Maria", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00Z", "source_utc_offset_minutes": 0}], "turn_id": "turn_0b2a5f19239d4a75a9b5367b98022755", "session_id": "session_76aef7fdd93f4f4db1078f1587ffe8f9", "sequence": 101}, {"request_id": "dialogue-102", "events": [{"role": "user", "content": "John: No problem, Maria. It's important to support each other when we're feeling down. You never know the difference a kind gesture can make.", "speaker": "John", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00Z", "source_utc_offset_minutes": 0}], "turn_id": "turn_db633da1cf2543f6bebff237b0959fe8", "session_id": "session_76aef7fdd93f4f4db1078f1587ffe8f9", "sequence": 102}, {"request_id": "dialogue-103", "events": [{"role": "user", "content": "Maria: Yep, kindness is key and a little compassion can really turn someone's day around. So glad we're on the same page here.", "speaker": "Maria", "occurred_at": "2023-01-28T13:17:00Z", "source_utc_offset_minutes": 0}], "turn_id": "turn_624bb553fca94e45ab66d780f2aec509", "session_id": "session_76aef7fdd93f4f4db1078f1587ffe8f9", "sequence": 103}]

